    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106647" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλο-μᾰνέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run to wood,</i> of the vine (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραγάω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
				<u>Ho.</u>
				10.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				5.40.1
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδία ὑλομανοῦντα</span>”
				<i>overgrown with thick wood,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.6.5
				</span></i>
			: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλλομανέω.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph. of language,
			etc., <i>run riot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὸ μυθῶδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.15e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
